The playbook (the starting file for a new state) was last updated on 10-23. This brings it up to date with everything decided and measured since:
- keep fitting officer GPS; GPS repair statewide;
- TIGER union fixed and on;
- approximate tiers (freeway 0.5 mi, NAD 400 ft); FARS before approximate;
- run 10 numbers and buckets;
- the D3 GPS split (#305, #306);
- a new section 6 on state-highway rates (AADT join rules, calendar-year blend, mainline-only counting #297, ramps #300, small numbers, rate groups #294/#298).

It also adds a rule at the top: every PR that changes placement, counting or rates updates this file in the same PR. Two stale lines in freeway-crashes.md are marked as replaced, and 8 lessons are added (10-25 to 10-31).

Knowledge only, no code. Decisions cited are the user's, already in docs/03 (#297 via #303).

